  "content": "<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/JI46iCIS5QA\" title=\"YouTube 影片播放器\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/RKStudios-hub/pixelart-assets/main/new.png\">\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/RKStudios-hub/pixelart-assets/main/line.png\" width=\"400\">\n</p> \n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <b>輕量級 • 可自訂 • 基於事件的空投</b>\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/RKStudios-hub/pixelart-assets/main/line.png\" width=\"400\">\n</p>\n\n\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <b>✨ 功能特色</b><br>\n  包含帶有可配置間隔的定時空投事件、用於手動觸發空投的無線電控制器、自訂戰利品表和箱子類型、基於 JSON 的配置系統，以及與其他模組的無縫相容性。\n</p>\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/RKStudios-hub/pixelart-assets/main/2026-04-06_19.45.23.png\">\n  <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/RKStudios-hub/pixelart-assets/main/2026-04-06_20.25.05.png\">\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img width=\"400\" alt=\"divider\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a796531e-5f22-4a58-9476-d99b5015a1b4\" />\n</p>\n\n<!-- SOCIALS -->\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"https://discord.gg/VrcVft4GEf\"><img src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3d4e037e-2e65-4f5d-ab71-8a46ba8a60a7\" width=\"60\" height=\"60\" alt=\"Discord\"/></a>\n  &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\n  <a href=\"#\"><img src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2d3adbcc-01ce-4c01-82ef-82c628cbc20f\" width=\"60\" height=\"60\" alt=\"Twitter\"/></a>\n  &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\n  <a href=\"#\"><img src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/cf2a5174-83ae-4f22-9015-3ec21263d550\" width=\"60\" height=\"60\" alt=\"Like\"/></a>\n  &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\n  <a href=\"#\"><img src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8d846e2a-e4b4-4502-ab7f-3ab2590e1e32\" width=\"60\" height=\"60\" alt=\"YouTube\"/></a>\n  &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\n  <a href=\"#\"><img src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2d416633-6809-4f5f-85cd-bb17d4ddf0f0\" width=\"60\" height=\"60\" alt=\"Donate\"/></a>\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img width=\"400\" alt=\"divider\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a796531e-5f22-4a58-9476-d99b5015a1b4\" />\n</p>\n\n<br>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <b>⚙️ 相容性</b><br>\n  專為 Forge 打造，支援 Minecraft 1.20.1。\n</p>\n\n<br>\n\n<div align=\"center\">\n  <strong>📦 需求</strong><br>\n  需要 GeckoLib 以支援動畫方塊模型。<br><br>\n  <strong>注意：</strong>從 v1.0.5 版本開始，此模組需要 Cloth Config。\n</div>\n<br>\n\n<div align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/RKStudios-hub/pixelart-assets@main/geckolib.png\" width=\"300\">\n</div>\n\n\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/RKStudios-hub/pixelart-assets/main/line.png\" width=\"400\">\n</p> \n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <b>🛠️ 開發者</b><br>\n  RK Studios\n</p>\n\n<br>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <b>💬 備註</b><br>\n  🚧 持續改進中<br>\n  ✨ 更多功能即將推出\n</p>\n\n<br>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <b>📢 回饋</b><br>\n  發現錯誤或有想法？<br>\n  → 在 GitHub 上開啟問題 (Issue)\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/RKStudios-hub/pixelart-assets/main/line.png\" width=\"400\">\n</p> \n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/RKStudios-hub/pixelart-assets/main/thankyou.png\" width=\"400\">\n</p>",
